 a blank overview line.","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"block","decision_margin":0.2889,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan: 'core factories carry ZERO argument help= text/description, so the curated per-option/per-subcommand text now in the artifacts has no render home' — the overview one-liners depend on descriptions that do not yet exist","Plan --check failure enumeration: 'missing/stale/stray artifact, unresolved factory, non-deterministic second render, registry/parser census mismatch, or generated package-data diff' — no clause for an empty/missing per-command overview summary","overview.txt today carries curated one-liners for every visible command; regenerated overview must not silently drop them to blank"],"finding":"The overview is generated from 'parser summaries', but core factories currently carry zero description/help text (the plan itself notes this and mandates enrichment). The --check failure list covers stale/stray/missing artifacts and census mismatch but does not explicitly fail on a PRESENT-but-empty/degraded overview summary for a command whose factory was not (fully) enriched, so a silently blank one-liner could pass the gate.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f570d9b6c6aa4861d","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach — 'Generate the grouped overview from route group/order/visibility plus parser summaries' and Testing/AC list of --check failure conditions","norm_id":"n97b1bff3dd39331e","priority":0.8889,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A canonical visible command's factory is committed without a description; the generator renders an empty summary line and --check still passes because the artifact is present and deterministic"],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.8889,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"missing_oracle","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"certification_cannot_prove","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.9,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Add `_bridge_commands._group_help()` (_bridge_commands.py:63, emitted at :257) and `transition.py:748`'s `subcommand_help(\"reopen\")` to the BODY-content consumer census with dispositions, deriving the list via `find_referencing_symbols` on `_help.subcommand_help` plus a name-string grep, and pin their regenerated bodies with exact-bytes assertions.","cohort":["project.symbol-reference-completeness"],"criteria":["project.symbol-reference-completeness"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.275,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan: 'subcommand_help() BODY-content consumers (not the prefix) — tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_force_unification_blusterous.py:131 ... tests/unit/test_bridge_projects_surfaces_heldout.py:124 ...' (only two test files listed)","src/rebar/_cli/_bridge_commands.py:63 `return _help.subcommand_help(\"bridge\") or _parser().format_help()`, invoked at _bridge_commands.py:257 `sys.stdout.write(_group_help())`","src/rebar/_commands/transition.py:748 `text = _help.subcommand_help(\"reopen\")` then `sys.stderr.write(text)`","Census scope declared as 'consumers OUTSIDE src/rebar/_cli/help/' — both sites qualify"],"fin